      "text": "WE SEE YOU! On January 26, at around 8:30 PM, an Air and Marine Operations AS350 helicopter crew from the Laredo Air Branch spotted an ATV picking up two individuals who had just crossed the Rio Grande River on a raft. The ATV driver tried to drop off the subjects in a residential neighborhood, but quick action by US Border Patrol agents from Laredo South Station led to their interception. The ATV attempted to flee into the brush, but thanks to coordinated efforts with our air unit, all individuals were apprehended. Arrested were one U.S. citizen male, one adult male Mexican national, and one adult male Brazilian national. The ATV was also seized! #BorderSecurity #Teamwork",
      "text_resolved": "WE SEE YOU! On January 26, at around 8:30 PM, an Air and Marine Operations AS350 helicopter crew from the Laredo Air Branch spotted an ATV picking up two individuals who had just crossed the Rio Grande River on a raft. The ATV driver tried to drop off the subjects in a residential neighborhood, but quick action by US Border Patrol agents from Laredo South Station led to their interception. The ATV attempted to flee into the brush, but thanks to coordinated efforts with our air unit, all individuals were apprehended. Arrested were one U.S. citizen male, one adult male Mexican national, and one adult male Brazilian national. The ATV was also seized! #BorderSecurity #Teamwork",
